## 4. Shadow System

| Shadow | Dark | Light | Vibrant | helloDarwin |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `--shadow-card` | `0 4px 20px hsl(220 26% 8% / 0.4)` | `0 4px 20px hsl(220 14% 15% / 0.08)` | `0 4px 20px hsl(260 30% 5% / 0.5)` | `0 4px 20px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.06)` |
| `--shadow-elevated` | `0 8px 40px hsl(220 26% 8% / 0.6)` | `0 8px 40px hsl(220 14% 15% / 0.12)` | `0 8px 40px hsl(260 30% 5% / 0.7)` | `0 8px 40px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1)` |

### CSS Utility Classes

```css
.shadow-card     { box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
.shadow-elevated { box-shadow: var(--shadow-elevated); }
```

### Usage

- `.shadow-card`: All `<Card>` components (KPI cards, chart cards, feed)
- `.shadow-elevated`: Celebration popup images, employee photo circles, GIF images

