**File**: `src/components/Dashboard/LiveKPICard.tsx`

Real-time value with animation on change.

```
Card: shadow-card border-border transition-all duration-300 [ring-2 ring-primary/50 when animating]
└── CardContent: p-6 (compact) or p-8
    ├── Top row: flex items-start justify-between mb-4/5
    │   ├── Icon box: w-14/16 h-14/16 rounded-xl gradient-primary
    │   │   └── Icon: w-7/8 h-7/8 text-primary-foreground
