        └── Delta: text-xl font-bold [text-green-500 if positive, text-red-500 if negative]
            Shows ↑/↓ + absolute change number
```

**Number animation**: Steps through intermediate values at 30ms intervals, up to 20 steps. `isAnimating` flag adds `ring-2 ring-primary/50` to the card and `scale-105` to the number.

