## 2. Theme System

The app supports **4 themes** switched via `data-theme` attribute on `<html>`. Theme preference is persisted to `localStorage` under the key `dashboard-theme` using Zustand's `persist` middleware. Default theme is `dark`.

### Theme Application

```typescript
document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', themeName);
```

### Complete Token Table

All values are HSL (hue saturation% lightness%):

