| `--card-foreground` | `210 40% 98%` | `220 14% 15%` | `60 100% 97%` | `0 0% 13%` |
| `--popover` | `220 26% 14%` | `0 0% 100%` | `260 30% 12%` | `0 0% 100%` |
| `--popover-foreground` | `210 40% 98%` | `220 14% 15%` | `60 100% 97%` | `0 0% 13%` |
| `--primary` | `195 100% 50%` | `270 91% 65%` | `330 100% 60%` | `300 60% 45%` |
| `--primary-foreground` | `220 26% 14%` | `0 0% 100%` | `260 30% 12%` | `0 0% 100%` |
| `--secondary` | `220 20% 25%` | `220 14% 96%` | `260 25% 22%` | `40 20% 92%` |
| `--secondary-foreground` | `210 40% 98%` | `220 14% 15%` | `60 100% 97%` | `0 0% 13%` |
| `--muted` | `220 20% 20%` | `220 14% 96%` | `260 25% 20%` | `40 20% 94%` |
| `--muted-foreground` | `215 20% 65%` | `220 9% 46%` | `260 20% 70%` | `0 0% 45%` |
| `--accent` | `38 95% 55%` | `48 96% 53%` | `45 100% 55%` | `52 100% 50%` |
| `--accent-foreground` | `220 26% 14%` | `220 14% 15%` | `260 30% 12%` | `0 0% 13%` |
| `--success` | `142 76% 45%` | `160 84% 39%` | `150 100% 45%` | `168 76% 42%` |
| `--success-foreground` | `210 40% 98%` | `0 0% 100%` | `260 30% 12%` | `0 0% 100%` |
