### Theme Character

- **Dark**: Cyan primary, gold accent, dark navy background. Tech/monitoring feel.
- **Light**: Purple primary, yellow accent, warm off-white background. Professional/brand.
- **Vibrant**: Hot pink primary, gold accent, deep purple background. Celebration/party mode.
- **helloDarwin**: Magenta primary, yellow accent, warm cream background. Brand identity.

