## 21. Complete Animation Catalog

### Custom Keyframe Animations

| Name | Keyframes | Duration | Easing | Loop | Start State |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `confetti-enhanced` | `translateY(-20vh → 20vh → 50vh → 75vh → 110vh)`, `rotate(0 → 180 → 360 → 540 → 720deg)`, `scale(1 → 1.2 → 0.8 → 1.1 → 0.5)`, `translateX(0 → 20px → -20px → 10px → -10px)`, `opacity(1 → 1 → 1 → 0.8 → 0)` | 4s | `cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94)` | infinite | — |
| `celebration-entrance` | `scale(0.3) translateY(50px) opacity(0)` → `scale(1.1) translateY(-10px)` → `scale(0.95) translateY(5px)` → `scale(1) translateY(0) opacity(1)` | 0.8s | `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` | once (forwards) | `scale(0.3) opacity(0)` |
| `photo-bounce` | `scale(0) translateY(30px) opacity(0)` → `scale(1.15) translateY(-15px)` → `scale(0.95) translateY(5px)` → `scale(1) translateY(0) opacity(1)` | 0.7s | `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` | once (forwards) | `opacity: 0` |
| `title-glow` | `text-shadow: 0 0 30px/60px gold(0.5/0.3), brightness(1)` ↔ `text-shadow: 0 0 50px/100px gold(0.8/0.5), brightness(1.2)` | 2s | ease-in-out | infinite | — |
| `gif-entrance` | `scale(0.5) translateY(30px) opacity(0)` → `scale(1) translateY(0) opacity(1)` | 0.6s | `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` | once (forwards), 0.5s delay | `opacity: 0` |
| `pulse-glow` | `box-shadow: 0 0 20px primary(0.3)` ↔ `box-shadow: 0 0 40px primary(0.6)` | 2s | ease-in-out | infinite | — |
| `epic-shake` | `translateX` alternating between `0`, `-5px`, `+5px` over 10 keyframe steps | 0.5s | ease-in-out | once | — |
| `epic-glow` | `box-shadow: 0 0 40/80/120px amber` ↔ `box-shadow: 0 0 60/120/180px amber` | 2s | ease-in-out | infinite | — |

### Spring Easing Note

The easing `cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)` is a **spring overshoot** curve — it overshoots the target and bounces back, giving a lively, bouncy feel to entrances.

