## 29. Realtime & Connection Indicators

### Supabase Realtime Channels

| Channel | Table | Event | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dashboard-feed-changes-{timestamp}` | `dashboard_feed` | INSERT | New feed posts |
| `spotify-songs-realtime` | `slack_spotify_songs` | INSERT | New Spotify songs |
| `pending-celebrations-{timestamp}` | `pending_celebrations` | INSERT | New celebration triggers |

### Reconnection Strategy

- Max attempts: 5
- Backoff: Exponential (`2^attempt * 1000ms`)
- Triggers reconnect on: `CHANNEL_ERROR`, `TIMED_OUT`
- Resets attempts on: successful `SUBSCRIBED`
- Also reconnects on: tab visibility change (`visibilitychange` event), auth token refresh

### Periodic Refresh

- Dashboard feed: every 30 seconds
- Quote rotation check: every 60 seconds

